", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]],\"$L10\"]}]\n11:T401,<h1>Jewellery Showroom - Premium LED Display Lighting, UAE</h1><p>A luxury jewellery showroom needed LED display and lighting solutions that would showcase gold, diamond, and precious stone collections with exceptional br</p><p>A luxury jewellery showroom needed LED display and lighting solutions that would showcase gold, diamond, and precious stone collections with exceptional brilliance and true-to-life colour accuracy. Standard retail lighting distorted gemstone colours and failed to create the premium ambiance expected by high-net-worth clientele.</p><p>Brightluxx designed a jewellery-specific LED lighting and display package. Ultra-high-CRI LED spotlights were installed in every display cabinet, calibrated to 4000K for optimal gold warmth and diamond sparkle. A behind-counter LED video display runs luxury brand videos and close-up product showcases. The lighting system includes individual dimming for each cabinet, allowing staff to create spotlight effects for featured collections.</p><p>Location: UAE</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Jewellery Showroom - Premium LED Display Lighting, UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A luxury jewellery showroom needed LED display and lighting solutions that would showcase gold, diamond, and precious stone collections with exceptional br\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/case-studies/jewellery-showroom-led-display-lighting\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"s